{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Square: Trial and Error</u> is a Puzzle Platformer game where you are tasked with restoring Town Square by completing 20 Trial and Error puzzles!<br><br>Each level has its own set of rules that you need to figure out by Trial and Error. No hints or clues are given in each level, and you must rely on observation and the outcome of your actions to figure out each level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a ton of features and fun for you to have! Find buried treasure, solve the riddle of the glitch zone, form your party, decorate your own home, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848430/extras/9a75c258143db22a7e05085eda9515d1.avif?t=1757840487\" width=443 height=94 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Trial and Error levels!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Bonus and 2 extra levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable Housing!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ outfits to unlock and wear!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Glitch Zone Levels!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lively Town Hub with fun NPC\u2019s to interact with!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find pets and let them accompany you on your journey!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose and create your own party of followers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Game pass!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No 50Gig updates!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Blood donations required to play!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848430/extras/c3aaed6f2870bc3fd3501438183770b0.avif?t=1757840487\" width=696 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848430/extras/a6491ff02627066d49b1e28306005bf9.avif?t=1757840487\" width=704 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848430/extras/7a01a04689d6de6fc4ff058c74af0b50.avif?t=1757840487\" width=597 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Want some unfair difficulty?</i> The Glitch Zone is the place for you! Replay the normal levels with the Glitch zone effect! A difficulty purposely made to be unfair with various game breaking effects! <u><i>Only in the glitch zone</i></u>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848430/extras/8c190f34e70a776f1374de9c12bf6a72.avif?t=1757840487\" width=800 height=582 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Starting Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3848430/5e5da2b83069d30781013a30dce584060810709a.jpg"},{"name":"5 down, 15 to go!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3848430/cc9c4e9128711d9c964dc34f0bf1e382155588e3.jpg"},{"name":"Halfway there, living on a prayer! ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3848430/ed512f119d24632e10d88f4f6